<section class="hero">
  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
  <p class="promise">
    Issue mobile driver's licenses and digital IDs that residents truly control —
    verifiable in person or online, with the wallet of their choice, and without
    locking citizens to a government-approved app.
  </p>
