<section class="scenario">
  <blockquote>
    A state DMV issues a mobile driver's license. The resident keeps it in any
    conformant wallet they trust. At a bar, an airport, or a checkout, they prove
    they're over 21 — or that the license is valid — without handing over their
    full identity, and without the verifier phoning the state.
  </blockquote>
</section>

<section class="fit">
